swer questions after I present the story. May I proceed?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Reporter</span>: Go ahead.", "time": "100", "id": 1}, {"image": "engenn8le09ob10re2img06.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: We were terribly distressed to learn that Holly's outsources its labor at a production plant that employs children. Now this is common and legal in Tindasia, but we have a strong ethical stand against child labor.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Reporter</span>: If you have a strong ethical stand how can you support this company?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Please let me explain. We are ethical so we support Holly's commitment to change. Farmani was unaware that children work at his factory. He was shocked and outraged at the discovery.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Reporter</span>: If you didn't know what was happening, then how could you inform Farmani? I'm confused.", "time": "28500", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn8le09ob10re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: It would be clearer if I could explain without interruption. We found a rumor over social media and immediately followed up with an investigation. We wanted to know the truth.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Reporter</span>: If you wanted facts, why would you go to social media?\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Miranda</span>: Please hear me:  you and I both respect the public.  We found the real facts with a private investigator. What I want to emphasize is that we were shocked and distressed. Change will happen immediately.\n<br /><span class=\"strong\">Reporter</span>: That was Miranda Morehouse, shocked and distressed and about to change Tindasian society. Meanwhile, plenty of Tindasian adults remain for Holly's to exploit. Goodnight everyone!", "time": "63500", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}